    "created_at": "2022-02-18T19:42:53Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-02-18T19:42:53Z",
    "body": "That seems very useful.\r\n\r\nI'd also like to be able to filter on whether the device permission is already granted. That would allow apps to exclude already-granted device permissions so the user is only choosing between new devices. The inverse could also be useful: filtering to show only the already-granted device permissions. You won't grant any permissions with that filter but it's a cheap way to add a chooser to your app.",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
